WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
narrator: Start the local three-peer control-plane fixture.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
narrator: Write an example policy for traffic from Alice to Bob.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
narrator: The rule is directional; it does not grant reverse traffic.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:31.000
narrator: Run the embedded policy checker and inspect its output.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
narrator: Submit the policy through the fixture's admin HTTP API.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:54.000
narrator: Request the current policy; inspect any reported errors.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.000
narrator: List nodes; this tape does not test packet-level policy enforcement.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:14.000
narrator: Remove the mesh fixture.
